    <string name="section_gpio_pins">GPIO Pins</string>
    <string name="gpio_pins_help">Configure the ESP32 GPIO pins connected to your shutter and focus optocouplers.\n\n• Only safe output-capable pins are listed.\n• Changes are sent to the device immediately and persisted in flash.\n• The shutter and focus pins must be different.\n• Not available in simulator mode.</string>
